- test-corpus-asan supplies MO_EXE/MO_CORPUS/MO_STRESS/MO_NATIVE_ASAN to its test child.
- --prefix changes b.getInstallPath(.bin, mo), so the test child receives the fresh-prefix mo path.
- MO_NATIVE_ASAN selects literal clang for runtime/generated-C compile and final link.
- Generated C and runtime source use -fsanitize=address -O1 -g -fno-omit-frame-pointer -DMO_ADDRESS_SANITIZER.
- Generated-C instrumentation is source-established only; no artifact was built or inspected in this grant.
- Zig remains required for brick objects; findZig first checks beside installed mo, then approved PATH.
